# WS3-07. Sources: spec/17-codegen.md §7: an exported function of module `get` is
# `cl_get__Point`, and the instance get<Point> is `cl_<name>__<typekey>` =
# `cl_get__Point`; the scheme promises "a user identifier cannot collide with a
# generated key". The program must build and print "1 102" on every profile.
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: output
contrast: _Point(2) ==> _Point(3)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
1 102
--- contrast-output
1 103
